      "id": "problem",
      "section": "problem",
      "layout": "big-statement",
      "duration_s": 17.2,
      "narration": "Every team at this hackathon has to submit a demo video. Most of us are making it right now, at 3 a.m. A good one needs a script, a clean recording, editing, a voiceover and captions. That's hours you don't have.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "kinetic_headline",
          "text": "The demo video is due at 11:59 AM",
          "animation": "word-by-word"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Write a script",
            "Record a clean demo",
            "Edit, voice and caption it"
          ],
          "animation": "slide-up"
        }
      ],
      "transition_in": "fade"
    },
    {
      "id": "solution",
      "section": "solution",
      "layout": "big-statement",
      "duration_s": 7,
      "narration": "Pit Crew makes the pitch video for you. Paste your live link, or just your GitHub repo.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "kinetic_headline",
          "text": "Paste a link. Get a pitch.",
          "animation": "word-by-word"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Live link or GitHub repo → a narrated 1080p pitch video",
          "role": "body"
        }
      ],
      "transition_in": "fade"
    },
    {
